<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">TITPOK.SFK 25-05-2,007 ADELINA QUEJ POKOMCHI Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">TITO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">TITO</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I TITO</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik rusuqkiil k'uxliis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin i Pablo raj kamanoom i Dios, hin raj tahqaneel i Jesucristo, inutz'ihb'aaj reje aweh i huuj wili i hat Tito. Re' xraaj i reh chi naa nuye'em rukowiil kik'ux i sik'ooj cho kiwach ruum i Dios, reh chi neenkireq chi riij i korik, i ruk'am chaloq i qanimaniik. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' i ch'iklik reje wii' qak'ux chureqariik i juneliik k'acharik, re' ruq'orom cho rib'iral i Dios noq komajaa' i rutz'uhkrisaj chee wach ak'al. Re' Dios ma' inchukwik ta q'orik re' i ruq'orom chaloq narojiik eloq wach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Raaj noq xponik ruq'ijil chuwach i Dios, xuyeew cho qeh chi naab'jik i ruk'uhb'aal. Eh re' ruq'orariik rib'iral i ruk'uhb'aal re' re', re' hin xirupab'aa' chub'anariik i Dios, i aj Ko'len qeh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hermano Tito, re' hat, hat wak'uun noq wilkaat, ruuk' i nimanik. Re' ta naq i Ajaab'ees Dios, i Jesucristo qaj Ko'loom neen kiyeew chaaweh i kotob'il, je' wo' hoq i suq kiil k'uxliis.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' rukamaj i Dios xub'an i Tito ar Creta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin, Tito, xat nukanaa' pee chaloq chupaam i ye'aab' Creta, reh chi naa ayejaam i komajaa' inkorjik, eh chi naa apab'aam taqe i kamanoom chi kixilak i aj nimaneel chupaam i ju'jun chi tinamit, je' rukab' i nuq'orom chaaweh: <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' to'ool chi kixilak i aj nimaneel, re' i k'acharik i rub'an parukorkiil, reh chi ma' xtaj neenq'ilarik wii'. Eh xa jinaj-oq i rehk'een chuwach, aj nimaneel-oq wo' taqe i rak'uun rixq'uun. Reh chi ma' nee ta nq'orarik chi ma' tiklik tamb'anik. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' i k'amal kib'eeh i aj nimaneel, raj kamanoom i Dios. Ruum aj re', koruman chi korik-oq wach i ruk'achariik. Mo'-oq xa ja'lik chii' wach, mo'-oq xa nk'atzk'otik, mo'-oq xohk'reel laj winaq, mo'-oq sik'il peleto, eh mo'-oq k'axal wach tumiin chi nee rureq chi xama' xta rub'ehel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chuyeew rupatal taqe rulaa', marukanaa' rub'anariik i otob'il, wilik-oq runa'ojb'al, korik-oq wach ruk'ux, wilik-oq rusantohiil, eh loch'ooj-oq naah chi korik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh ruye'em-oq ruk'ux chunimjiik i korik laj k'uhb'aal, re' i xtijik wii' i reh. Chi je' re' neerub'an ruye'ariik rukowiil kik'ux i tokoom, eh nee wo' ruch'ub'isaj kik'ux taqe i ki-ixowanik reh i k'uhb'aal re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruum ma' k'isiin taqe i ma' nkaaj ta nimanik. Eh re' i kib'anik ree re', re' taqe i kow inkiq'or chi koruman chi naa rupoch'ariik naah k'achab'. Eh xama' xta rub'ehel taqe inkiq'or, xa re' jot'ooj inki a'n <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe re', q'ilarik inkaaj, ruum re' keh xa kiooj chi yojoj k'uxliis chi' taq paat. Xa reh reh inkik'uhtaaj re' i ma' ruk'ul ta chi k'uhtjik xa re' inkaaj inkireq kitumiin chi xama' xta rub'ehel. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh jinaj wo' i winaq xwihik cho chi k'amal kib'eeh i aj Creta je' wili xuq'or chikiij i rutinamiit: Re' taqe aj Creta chukul q'orik taqe, je' taqe josq'laj chikop. Q'e' taqe kiwi'k, q'e' taqe sikiil, inki. <verse number="13" style="v" />Korik i xuq'or i winaq re' re', ruum aj re', re' i hat Tito, chaq'il taqe chi kow i kiq'asam chik kiib', reh chi neenkowjik kik'ux chi nimanik. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh reh wo' chi ma' nee ta nkinimaj i k'utaaj xa nkiyejaa' wach pankik'ux taqe aj judío, eh ni xata neenkinimaj i xa kik'uhb'aal taqe inkiyeew i kiij reh i korik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe saq wach i kikapeb'aal, chu'nchel i ruyejaam i Dios xa saq wo' wach chi keh. Eh re' taqe i ma' kinimanik ta reh i Dios i ch'uwa' wach kikapeb'aal, xa chu'nchel ch'uwa' wach chi keh, ruum xa ch'uwa' wo' wach i kina'ojb'al. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh inkiq'or chi nkinimaj i Dios. Xanaah re', ruuk' i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al ink'utinik chi ma' korik ta keh inki a'n Re' keh aj ixowaal taqe, ruum xa ja'lik kichii' kiwach, ma' xtaj i holohik inki a'n.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' korik laj k'uhb'aal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i naa ach'ob'om rub'ehel i hat Tito, re' aha' wilik i ruq'or i korik laj k'uhb'aal. <verse number="2" style="v" />Chaq'or wo' keh i mama' winaq chi mo'-oq teheeh kiwach, xa kiloch'ik-oq, holohik-oq i kina'ojb'al, kow-oq kik'ux chi nimanik, korik-oq keh i k'axooj inki a'n eh wilik-oq q'unil kuuk'. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wo' taqe i ati't ixoq xa kiloch'ik-oq, mo'-oq wo' taqe xa molol wach k'utaaj manki a'n wo' xohk'rik. Inchol la' kik'uhtaam i holohik laj na'ojb'al, <verse number="4" style="v" />chikiwach taqe ko q'ahxoq ixoq, reh chi nee wo' nkian ruk'axariik i kib'ahiil i keh je' wo' hoq i kak'uun kixq'uun. <verse number="5" style="v" />Holohik-oq wo' i kina'ojb'al taqe q'ahxoq ixoq re' re' korik-oq wach i kik'achariik, kian i kikamaj pankipaat xa atoob'-oq taqe, eh kinimaj i kib'ahiil. Chi je' re', ma' xta neen q'orarik chi riij i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tito, inwaaj wo' chi neenak'uhb'alej taqe k'ijolaq, reh chi holohik-oq i kina'ojb'al. <verse number="7" style="v" />Chak'uhtaaj keh i hat i holohik laj na'ojb'al ruuk' i xa chib'ih jariik i naa a'nam. Noq naa taqe ak'uhb'alem, cha a'n parukorkiil, mo'q xa sa'al ruuk' neena a'n. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh holohik kik'uhb'aljiik cha a'n, reh chi ma' awach ta neenq'atwik i q'orik cha naah. Ruuk' i re', neenchalik kik'ixiik taqe ixowan wach i korik laj k'uhb'aal, eh ma' nee ta wo' inkitz'aq k'utaaj chiqiij i hoj. <verse number="9" style="v" />Chakoj kina'ojb'al taqe wilkeeb' chi mosojik, reh chi neenkian i neen q'orarik keh ruum i kipatroon, xa atoob'-oq taqe, mo'-oq xa teheeh kiwach chi chaq'wik. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh maa nkelq'aaj i chib'ih reh i kipatroon. Kik'uhtaaj la' i rukorkiil wach kik'ux, reh chi chu'nchel neekikojwik rehtaal i xiik' naah holwochiil laj k'uhb'aal k'uhtamaj cho keh chi riij i Dios, i qaj Ko'loom.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Dios xuk'uhtaaj cho qeh i runimaal i rotob'il, re' naq xraaj i reh chi chu'nchel i tinamit wach ak'al naakiko'leem kiib'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh i ruk'uhtaaj wo' qeh chi naa qakanaam rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, je' wo' hoq i rukanab'jiik xa chib'ih jariik inak'ax wach rub'aan ayu'. Eh je' wo' chi naa qak'achariik parukorkiil, eh chi korik-oq wach qak'ux ruuk' i korik. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh i ruyeew rukowiil qak'ux ruuk' i rotob'il, reh chi neenqa a'n ruyub'jiik i loq'laj rojiik eloq wach i ruq'orom cho rib'iral qeh, re' i ruk'uliik ruka'peech i runimaal wach qaDios, qaj Ko'loom Jesucristo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' reh xuyeew riib' pan ti'laj kimik chiqiij i hoj, reh chi xojruko'leej chuwach mahk. Eh xojrukanaa' chi ma' xta chik ruch'uwa'iil wach i qánima. Eh xojrukoj chi hoj rak'uun rixq'uun, reh chi xa re' chik i holohik laj na'ojb'al qootwaaj rub'aan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe wili naa ak'uhb'alem wii'. Chayeew rukowiil kik'ux. Chak'uhtaaj awajaawriik chi kiq'ilariik. Mayeew q'ab' chi neenkixow awach.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i holohik laj na'ojb'al naa kianam i aj nimaneel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hat Tito, cha q'or keh aj nimaneel chi kinimanoq chikiwach taqe ajaab'ees, chikiwach i xa reh reh wach kajaawriik chi taaq'anik. Eh kian i holohik laj na'ojb'al. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mo'-oq awach ineenkitz'aq k'utaaj chi riij. Kik'acharoq parukorkiil, xa atoob'-oq taqe. Kik'uhtaaj ruch'ub'kiil wach i kánima chikiwach chu'nchel i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hoj noq xub'an chaloq ma' xta naq qana'ojb'al. Ma' nqanimaj ta naq i Dios. Ma' qeht'al ta naq wach i korik, re' naq inqa a'n i ruk'ax wach i qati'jolal. Pamahk naq k'acharik inqa a'n, eh hoj naq aj kaqwachineel. Yiib' naq wach qohb'anik k'ul naq inqixowaaj qawach. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh noq re' Dios i qaj Ko'loom xuyeew i rotob'il, xuyeew wo' i ruk'axb'al chikinaah i tinamit wach ak'al. <verse number="5" style="v" />Xojruko'leej i ma' ruum ta chi wilik taj i holohik xqa a'n, xa ruum la' chi xuketelaaj qawach. Ruuk' i ruqahteesjiik qahaa' xb'aan, xk'utinik chi xojruko'leej. Eh re' Dios xuyeew q'ab' qeh chi ruuk' i rajaawriik i Santolaj Uxlab'al xujal qawach, xuyeew qeh i jinaj ak' laj k'acharik. <verse number="6" style="v" />Parub'ihnaal i Jesucristo, i qaj Ko'loom, xuyeew cho qeh i Dios chi manlik i Santolaj Uxlab'al. <verse number="7" style="v" />Je' re' xub'an i Dios, re' xraaj i reh, noq hoj chik ruko'leem chuwach i qamahk ruuk' i rotob'il, naa ruye'em qeh i juneliik k'acharik re' i k'ahchi' quy-eem.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe wili xti korik, ruum aj re', maa kanaa' chik ruq'orariik taqe, reh chi neen kiyeew kik'ux chub'anariik i holohik i kinimanik reh i Dios. Re' taqe na'ojb'al wili ma' xta reet chi b'anarik, eh chu'nchel aj eh neen kamanik wii'. <verse number="9" style="v" />Xa re' la', maayeew q'ab' chi neenb'aan i xa memil laj wech'inik, re' ruk'uhtjiik i xa nkiyejaa' wach chikiij i qamaam qati't, je' wo' taqe k'ahinik iib', i peletohinik iib', choqinik iib' chi riij i najtir k'uhb'aal. Re' taqe re' xama' xta rutiq wach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Wila' awach imb'anik reh i yojoj k'uxliis, chaq'il junriim oon ka'pech-oq, eh wi ma' xnimanik, chawesaj cho chi kixilak i aj nimaneel. <verse number="11" style="v" />Xa ruuk' i re', nee nanaab'eej chi ma' xta runa'ojb'al i yojol k'uxliis re' re' xa re' ru mahk k'ahchi' ruye'wiik reh panti' k'axik.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' rukojariik runa'ojb'al i Tito xub'an i San Pablo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hat Tito, noq naa nutaq'aam reje awuuk' i hermano Artemas oon re' i Tíquico, cha chop chak'ux chi ojik, reh chi neenqak'ul qiib' ar Nicópolis, ruum re' hin xnukapaaj chik chi ar naa wik'sam iq'ilej. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh chatoob'eej Zenas re' inq'orik reh i k'uhb'aal, ruch'ihil i hermano Apolos. Eh chayeew keh i ajwaal wach reh i kib'eeh reh chi ma' xta ti' neenkil wach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Reh chi re' taqe i quch aj nimaneel neenkitijej keh otob'il re' re', reh chi neen inki a'n i toob'inik xanik' pa' ajwaal wach. Chi je' re' nee kiwachinik ruuk' i kinimaniik.</para>
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik suq kiil k'uxliis rupahqaljiik i rotob'il i Dios xkuxik wii' wach rutz'ihb'jiik i huuj wili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu'nchel taqe i hermano wuch'ihil ayu' inkitaq'aaj rusuqkiil ak'ux. Chayeew rusuqkiil kik'ux taqe i loq'laj hermano ar. Re' ta naq i Dios toob'inoq taq aweh. Je' ta wo' naq re'.</para>
</usx>